{"3772960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "UMIGARI | ウミガリ", "steam_appid": 3772960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UMIGARI</strong> is a first-person harpoon fishing game set in the foggy waters off the coast of Japan. Hunt fish with your harpoon, sell your catch, buy fuel, and upgrade your gear. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alone at sea, the more you explore, the stranger the fish become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Estimated playtime: 2–4 hours</strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Horror intensity: Very Light</strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>This game is unlike our past games. If you’re looking for a hardcore horror experience, this may not be for you.</strong></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hunt with Precision</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Skillfully use your harpoon to catch a variety of fish, testing your timing and accuracy with every strike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772960/extras/9838535db3de6070276f7a8ea1a8f8b6.poster.avif?t=1770375007\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772960/extras/9838535db3de6070276f7a8ea1a8f8b6.webm?t=1770375007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772960/extras/9838535db3de6070276f7a8ea1a8f8b6.mp4?t=1770375007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772960/extras/9229e6d164e3e674e7c0298e81a2e518.poster.avif?t=1770375007\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772960/extras/9229e6d164e3e674e7c0298e81a2e518.webm?t=1770375007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772960/extras/9229e6d164e3e674e7c0298e81a2e518.mp4?t=1770375007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Ship &amp; Gear</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade your catch for cash to enhance your ship’s speed and fuel capacity, allowing you to venture deeper into uncharted waters and discover new islands and hidden treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772960/extras/e613c828c35b942a869b09826454e9ac.poster.avif?t=1770375007\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772960/extras/e613c828c35b942a869b09826454e9ac.webm?t=1770375007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772960/extras/e613c828c35b942a869b09826454e9ac.mp4?t=1770375007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Utilize Boat Equipment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find equipment scattered around the world to aid your fish hunting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772960/extras/075080f16a662e80d58110f42dabaced.poster.avif?t=1770375007\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772960/extras/075080f16a662e80d58110f42dabaced.webm?t=1770375007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772960/extras/075080f16a662e80d58110f42dabaced.mp4?t=1770375007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fish that react to you</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some fish are smarter than you think.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772960/extras/dd670782a276581855608ab0f7bbad9b.poster.avif?t=1770375007\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772960/extras/dd670782a276581855608ab0f7bbad9b.webm?t=1770375007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772960/extras/dd670782a276581855608ab0f7bbad9b.mp4?t=1770375007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>In-Game Music (Royalty Free)</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Stock Media provided by AdiGoldstein / Pond5</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Stock Media provided by tunes2you / Pond5</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>You are allowed to upload gameplay videos, stream, and create other broadcast content for all Chilla’s Art games.</i></strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UMIGARI</strong> is a first-person harpoon fishing game set in the foggy waters off the coast of Japan. Hunt fish with your harpoon, sell your catch, buy fuel, and upgrade your gear. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alone at sea, the more you explore, the stranger the fish become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Estimated playtime: 2–4 hours</strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Horror intensity: Very Light</strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>This game is unlike our past games. If you’re looking for a hardcore horror experience, this may not be for you.</strong></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hunt with Precision</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Skillfully use your harpoon to catch a variety of fish, testing your timing and accuracy with every strike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772960/extras/9838535db3de6070276f7a8ea1a8f8b6.poster.avif?t=1770375007\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772960/extras/9838535db3de6070276f7a8ea1a8f8b6.webm?t=1770375007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772960/extras/9838535db3de6070276f7a8ea1a8f8b6.mp4?t=1770375007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772960/extras/9229e6d164e3e674e7c0298e81a2e518.poster.avif?t=1770375007\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772960/extras/9229e6d164e3e674e7c0298e81a2e518.webm?t=1770375007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https